    "Scouting Notes": "Corner outfielder with a plus arm.\n Shown some impressive exit velocities for his age.\n There is some definite swing and miss concern but the arm/power combo is intriguing.\n Fairly projectable frame with lightning quick hands and above average bat speed.\n Swing path is direct and shows ability to drive the ball to all fields.\n Good athlete, and a very smooth swing, which is why I think he may be able to figure out the swing and miss and become decent enough there.\n Not the fastest, but above average speed and certainly enough to be a decent baserunner.\n The bat could really pop if he can rein in the swing and miss.",
